nator Bidang Pangan.\"},\"widget_content_description_en\":{\"old_552\":\"It is a system for the joint utilization of laws and regulations in the food sector and other legal documentation materials in an orderly, integrated, and sustainable manner and is a means of providing legal information services easily, quickly, and accurately. The JDIH of the Coordinating Ministry for Food is a system built to carry out some of the main tasks and functions of the Legal Bureau of the Secretariat of the Coordinating Ministry for Food, namely the preparation of documentation and information on laws and regulations in the food sector, especially those related to the main tasks and functions of the Coordinating Ministry for Food.\"},\"meta_title_id\":\"Landasan Hukum\",\"meta_title_en\":\"Legal Foundation\",\"meta_keywords_id\":null,\"meta_keywords_en\":null,\"meta_description_id\":null,\"meta_description_en\":null,\"meta_image\":\"{\\\"path\\\":\\\"images\\/banner\\/banner-about.jpg\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"b...\",\"sort_id\":\"1\",\"is_active\":\"1\",\"unique\":\"2\"}','2025-11-18 14:27:50','2025-11-18 14:27:50'),(324,1,'root','root','menu','edit','2','Landasan Hukum','{\"parent_id\":\"3\",\"label_id\":\"Landasan Hukum\",\"label_en\":\"Legal Foundation\",\"permalink_id\":\"landasan-hukum\",\"permalink_en\":\"legal-foundation\",\"widget_banner\":{\"old_551\":\"2\"},\"widget_banner_image\":{\"old_551\":\"{\\\"path\\\":\\\"assets\\/thumbs\\/images\\/banner\\/cover_1440_400_banner-about.jpg.webp\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"cover_1440_400_banner-about.jpg.webp\\\",\\\"ext\\\":\\\"webp\\\",\\\"size\\\":145082,\\\"ctime\\\":1763475049,\\\"image-width\\\":1440,\\\"image-height\\\":400,\\\"alt_id\\\":\\\"banner\\\"}\"},\"alt_id\":\"banner\",\"alt_en\":null,\"widget_banner_image-medium\":{\"old_551\":\"{\\\"path\\\":\\\"assets\\/thumbs\\/images\\/banner\\/cover_1024_480_banner-about.jpg.webp\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"cover_1024_480_banner-about.jpg.webp\\\",\\\"ext\\\":\\\"webp\\\",\\\"size\\\":99400,\\\"