"image-width\\\":375,\\\"image-height\\\":340}\"},\"widget_banner_subtitle_id\":{\"old_1280\":\"TENTANG KAMI\"},\"widget_banner_subtitle_en\":{\"old_1280\":\"ABOUT US\"},\"widget_banner_title_id\":{\"old_1280\":\"Visi Misi\"},\"widget_banner_title_en\":{\"old_1280\":\"Vision Mission\"},\"widget_vision\":{\"old_1281\":\"5\"},\"widget_vision_image\":{\"old_1281\":\"{\\\"path\\\":\\\"assets\\/thumbs\\/images\\/cover_1070_240_bg-visi.png.webp\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"cover_1070_240_bg-visi.png.webp\\\",\\\"ext\\\":\\\"webp\\\",\\\"size\\\":9388,\\\"ctime\\\":1761882074,\\\"image-width\\\":1070,\\\"image-height\\\":240,\\\"alt_id\\\":\\\"visi\\\"}\"},\"widget_vision_image-medium\":{\"old_1281\":\"{\\\"path\\\":\\\"assets\\/thumbs\\/images\\/cover_1024_400_bg-visi.png.webp\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"cover_1024_400_bg-visi.png.webp\\\",\\\"ext\\\":\\\"webp\\\",\\\"size\\\":6198,\\\"ctime\\\":1762142404,\\\"image-width\\\":1024,\\\"image-height\\\":400}\"},\"widget_vision_image-small\":{\"old_1281\":\"{\\\"path\\\":\\\"assets\\/thumbs\\/images\\/cover_327_520_bg-visi-s.png.webp\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"cover_327_520_bg-visi-s.png.webp\\\",\\\"ext\\\":\\\"webp\\\",\\\"size\\\":4820,\\\"ctime\\\":1762142416,\\\"image-width\\\":327,\\\"image-height\\\":520}\"},\"widget_vision_subtitle_id\":{\"old_1281\":\"Visi Kami\"},\"widget_vision_subtitle_en\":{\"old_1281\":\"Our Vision\"},\"widget_vision_title_id\":{\"old_1281\":\"Menjadi Pusat Rujukan Informasi Hukum Pangan Nasional yang terintegrasi, cerdas (smart), dan terpercaya, yang berlandaskan pada nilai-nilai SIAP (Sinergi, Integritas, Adaptif, dan Profesional) sebagai pilar utama dalam mewujudkan tata kelola pemerint\"},\"widget_vision_title_en\":{\"old_1281\":\"To become an integrated, smart, and trusted National Food Law Information Reference Center, as a main pillar in realizing consistent, transparent, and accountable food governance.\"},\"widget_mission\":{\"old_1282\":\"6\"},\"widget_mission_title_id\":{\"old_1282\":\"MISI KAMI\"},\"widget_mission_title_en\":{\"old_1282\":\"OUR MISSION\"},\"widget_mission_content_id\":{\"old_1282\":\"<ul><li style=\\\"text-align:justify;\\\"><strong>Pengelolaan Dokumen dan Informasi Hukum Berbasis Integrasi Digital<\\/strong><\\/li><\\/ul><p style=\\\"margin-left:1.0cm;text-align:justify;\\\">Mengelola, menyediakan, dan menjamin keakuratan, kelengkapan, serta keseragaman dokumen hukum sektor pangan secara terpusat dan sistematis. Membangun platform JDIH yang terintegrasi dengan seluruh pemangku kepentingan untuk memastikan akses informasi yang cepat dan valid.<\\/p><ul><li style=\\\"text-align:justify;\\\"><strong>Peningkatan Transparansi dan Aksesibilitas Publik<\\/strong><\\/li><\\/ul><p style=\\\"margin-left:1.0cm;text-align:justify;\\\">Meningkatkan transparansi dan keterbukaan informasi hukum bidang pangan bagi publik, pemangku kepentingan, dan aparatur negara. Menyediakan akses mudah, akurat, dan gratis terhadap dokumen hukum, dan informasi legalitas kebijakan pangan melalui platform digital yang ramah pengguna.<\\/p><ul><li style=\\\"text-align:justify;\\\"><strong>Dukungan Strategis terhadap Formulasi dan Harmonisasi Kebijakan Pangan<\\/strong><\\/li><\\/ul><p style=\\\"margin-left:1.0cm;text-align:justify;\\\">Menyediakan dukungan analisis dan rekomendasi hukum yang berkualitas untuk meminimalisir konflik dan tumpang tindih regulasi. Memastikan bahwa setiap kebijakan pangan yang disusun konsisten, harmonis, dan selaras dengan kerangka hukum nasional dan internasional.<\\/p><ul><li style=\\\"text-align:justify;\\\"><strong>Pengembangan Sistem JDIH Cerdas (Smart) dan Kelembagaan Berkelanjutan<\\/strong><\\/li><\\/ul><p style=\\\"margin-left:1.0cm;text-align:justify;\\\">Mengembangkan sistem JDIH berbasis teknologi informasi yang adaptif dan berkelanjutan, termasuk pemanfaatan kecerdasan buatan (AI) untuk pemetaan hukum, penandaan regulasi, dan notifikasi otomatis. Memperkuat kolaborasi dengan pusat JDIHN dan anggota JDIHN lainnya untuk sinergi dokumentasi dan informasi hukum nasional.<\\/p>\"},\"widget_mission_content_en\":{\"old_1282\":\"<ul><li style=\\\"text-align:justify;\\\"><strong>Digitally Integrated Legal Document and Information Management<\\/strong>&nbsp;<\\/li><\\/ul><p style=\\\"margin-left:40px;text-align:justify;\\\">Manage, provide, and guarantee the accuracy, completeness, and uniformity of legal documents in the food sector in a centralized and systematic manner. Build an integrated JDIH platform with all stakeholders to ensure fast and valid access to information.&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<\\/p><ul><li><strong>Improving Public Transparency and Accessibility<\\/strong>&nbsp;<\\/li><\\/ul><p style=\\\"margin-left:40px;\\\">Improve transparency and openness of legal information in the food sector for the public, stakeholders, and state officials. Provide easy, accurate, and free access to legal documents and information on the legality of food policies through a user-friendly digital platform.&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<\\/p><ul><li><strong>Strategic Support for Food Policy Formulation and Harmonization<\\/strong>&nbsp;<\\/li><\\/ul><p style=\\\"margin-left:40px;\\\">Provide quality legal analysis and recommendations to minimize regulatory conflicts and overlaps. Ensure that every formulated food policy is consistent, harmonized, and aligned with national and international legal frameworks.&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<\\/p><ul><li><strong>Development of a Smart JDIH System and Sustainable Institutions<\\/strong>&nbsp;<\\/li><\\/ul><p style=\\\"margin-left:40px;\\\">Develop an adaptive and sustainable information technology-based JDIH system, including the use of artificial intelligence (AI) for legal mapping, regulatory tagging, and automatic notifications. Strengthening collaboration with JDIHN centers and other JDIHN members for synergy of national legal documentation and information.<\\/p>\"},\"meta_title_id\":\"Visi Misi\",\"meta_title_en\":\"Vision Mission\",\"meta_keywords_id\":null,\"meta_keywords_en\":null,\"meta_description_id\":null,\"meta_description_en\":null,\"meta_image\":\"{\\\"path\\\":\\\"images\\/banner\\/banner-about.jpg\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"b...\",\"sort_id\":\"4\",\"is_active\":\"1\",\"unique\":\"5\"}','2025-12-06 04:03:45','2025-12-06 04:03:45'),(1267,2,'superadmin','superadmin','menu','edit','5','Visi Misi','{\"parent_id\":\"3\",\"label_id\":\"Visi Misi\",\"label_en\":\"Vision Mission\",\"permalink_id\":\"visi-misi\",\"permalink_en\":\"vision-mission\",\"widget_banner\":{\"old_1334\":\"4\"},\"widget_banner_image\":{\"old_1334\":\"{\\\"path\\\":\\\"assets\\/thumbs\\/images\\/banner\\/cover_1440_400_banner-about.jpg.webp\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"cover_1440_400_banner-about.jpg.webp\\\",\\\"ext\\\":\\\"webp\\\",\\\"size\\\":145082,\\\"ctime\\\":1763557806,\\\"image-width\\\":1440,\\\"image-height\\\":400}\"},\"alt_id\":\"visi\",\"alt_en\":null,\"widget_banner_image-medium\":{\"old_1334\":\"{\\\"path\\\":\\\"assets\\/thumbs\\/images\\/banner\\/cover_1024_480_banner-about.jpg.webp\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"cover_1024_480_banner-about.jpg.webp\\\",\\\"ext\\\":\\\"webp\\\",\\\"size\\\":99400,\\\"ctime\\\":1763557811,\\\"image-width\\\":1024,\\\"image-height\\\":480}\"},\"widget_banner_image-small\":{\"old_1334\":\"{\\\"path\\\":\\\"assets\\/thumbs\\/images\\/banner\\/cover_375_340_banner-about.jpg.webp\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"cover_375_340_banner-about.jpg.webp\\\",\\\"ext\\\":\\\"webp\\\",\\\"size\\\":30368,\\\"ctime\\\":1763557818,\\\"image-width\\\":375,\\\"image-height\\\":340}\"},\"widget_banner_subtitle_id\":{\"old_1334\":\"TENTANG KAMI\"},\"widget_banner_subtitle_en\":{\"old_1334\":\"ABOUT US\"},\"widget_banner_title_id\":{\"old_1334\":\"Visi Misi\"},\"widget_banner_title_en\":{\"old_1334\":\"Vision Mission\"},\"widget_vision\":{\"old_1335\":\"5\"},\"widget_vision_image\":{\"old_1335\":\"{\\\"path\\\":\\\"assets\\/thumbs\\/images\\/cover_1070_240_bg-visi.png.webp\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"cover_1070_240_bg-visi.png.webp\\\",\\\"ext\\\":\\\"webp\\\",\\\"size\\\":9388,\\\"ctime\\\":176188207