<strong>Improving Public Transparency and Accessibility<\\/strong>&nbsp;<\\/li><\\/ul><p style=\\\"margin-left:40px;\\\">Improve transparency and openness of legal information in the food sector for the public, stakeholders, and state officials. Provide easy, accurate, and free access to legal documents and information on the legality of food policies through a user-friendly digital platform.&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<\\/p><ul><li><strong>Strategic Support for Food Policy Formulation and Harmonization<\\/strong>&nbsp;<\\/li><\\/ul><p style=\\\"margin-left:40px;\\\">Provide quality legal analysis and recommendations to minimize regulatory conflicts and overlaps. Ensure that every formulated food policy is consistent, harmonized, and aligned with national and international legal frameworks.&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<\\/p><ul><li><strong>Development of a Smart JDIH System and Sustainable Institutions<\\/strong>&nbsp;<\\/li><\\/ul><p style=\\\"margin-left:40px;\\\">Develop an adaptive and sustainable information technology-based JDIH system, including the use of artificial intelligence (AI) for legal mapping, regulatory tagging, and automatic notifications. Strengthening collaboration with JDIHN centers and other JDIHN members for synergy of national legal documentation and information.<\\/p>\"},\"meta_title_id\":\"Visi Misi\",\"meta_title_en\":\"Vision Mission\",\"meta_keywords_id\":null,\"meta_keywords_en\":null,\"meta_description_id\":null,\"meta_description_en\":null,\"meta_image\":\"{\\\"path\\\":\\\"images\\/banner\\/banner-about.jpg\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"b...\",\"sort_id\":\"4\",\"is_active\":\"1\",\"unique\":\"5\"}','2025-12-06 04:05:19','2025-12-06 04:05:19'),(1268,2,'superadmin','superadmin','menu','unpublish','23','Rancangan Peraturan','{\"publish\":\"0\",\"unique\":\"23\"}','2025-12-06 04:07:33','2025-12-06 04:07:33'),(1269,2,'superadmin','superadmin','menu','edit','7','Kontak Kami','{\"parent_id\":\"0\",\"label_id\":\"Kontak Kami\",\"label_en\":\"Contact Us\",\"permalink_id\":\