ny suggestions you provide are crucial for the improvement and advancement of our services.\"},\"widget_content_description_id\":{\"old_1286\":\"Ada pertanyaan seputar JDIH Kementerian Koordinator Bidang Pangan ? Kirim pesan kepada kami!\"},\"widget_content_description_en\":{\"old_1286\":\"Have questions about the Coordinating Ministry for Food and Agriculture\'s JDIH? Send us a message!\"},\"widget_contact\":{\"old_1287\":\"4\"},\"widget_contact_image\":{\"old_1287\":\"{\\\"path\\\":\\\"assets\\/thumbs\\/images\\/cover_990_287_bg-contactus.png.webp\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"cover_990_287_bg-contactus.png.webp\\\",\\\"ext\\\":\\\"webp\\\",\\\"size\\\":21704,\\\"ctime\\\":1763648815,\\\"image-width\\\":990,\\\"image-height\\\":287,\\\"alt_id\\\":\\\"bg\\\"}\"},\"widget_contact_image-medium\":{\"old_1287\":\"{\\\"path\\\":\\\"assets\\/thumbs\\/images\\/cover_688_373_bg-contactus-medium.png.webp\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"cover_688_373_bg-contactus-medium.png.webp\\\",\\\"ext\\\":\\\"webp\\\",\\\"size\\\":24162,\\\"ctime\\\":1763721372,\\\"image-width\\\":688,\\\"image-height\\\":373}\"},\"widget_contact_image-small\":{\"old_1287\":\"{\\\"path\\\":\\\"assets\\/thumbs\\/images\\/cover_327_624_bg-contactus-s.png.webp\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"cover_327_624_bg-contactus-s.png.webp\\\",\\\"ext\\\":\\\"webp\\\",\\\"size\\\":24592,\\\"ctime\\\":1763648824,\\\"image-width\\\":327,\\\"image-height\\\":624}\"},\"widget_contact_title_id\":{\"old_1287\":\"KANTOR KAMI\"},\"widget_contact_title_en\":{\"old_1287\":\"OUR OFFICE\"},\"widget_contact_address\":{\"old_1287\":\"Biro Hukum dan Kerjasama\\r\\nGraha Mandiri, Jl. Imam Bonjol, No. 61, Menteng, Kec. Menteng, Jakarta Pusat, Jakarta, 10310\"},\"widget_contact_phone\":{\"old_1287\":\"02131936802\"},\"widget_contact_email\":{\"old_1287\":\"jdih@kemenkopangan.go.id\"},\"widget_google-map\":{\"old_1288\":\"4\"},\"widget_google-map_label_id\":{\"old_1288\":\"Petunjuk Arah\"},\"widget_google-map_label_en\":{\"old_1288\":\"Directions\"},\"widget_google