eA7m_PmourChJdCb0zdrqd0hlD8dGUvApGYjXdH32GjR...\"}','2025-12-17 03:25:10','2025-12-17 03:25:10'),(1503,2,'superadmin','superadmin','menu','edit','2','Landasan Hukum','{\"parent_id\":\"3\",\"label_id\":\"Landasan Hukum\",\"label_en\":\"Legal Foundation\",\"permalink_id\":\"landasan-hukum\",\"permalink_en\":\"legal-foundation\",\"widget_banner\":{\"old_1244\":\"10\"},\"widget_banner_image\":{\"old_1244\":\"{\\\"path\\\":\\\"assets\\/thumbs\\/images\\/banner\\/cover_1440_400_banner-about.jpg.webp\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"cover_1440_400_banner-about.jpg.webp\\\",\\\"ext\\\":\\\"webp\\\",\\\"size\\\":145082,\\\"ctime\\\":1763475049,\\\"image-width\\\":1440,\\\"image-height\\\":400,\\\"alt_id\\\":\\\"banner\\\"}\"},\"alt_id\":\"banner\",\"alt_en\":null,\"widget_banner_image-medium\":{\"old_1244\":\"{\\\"path\\\":\\\"assets\\/thumbs\\/images\\/banner\\/cover_1024_480_banner-about.jpg.webp\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"cover_1024_480_banner-about.jpg.webp\\\",\\\"ext\\\":\\\"webp\\\",\\\"size\\\":99400,\\\"ctime\\\":1763475102,\\\"image-width\\\":1024,\\\"image-height\\\":480}\"},\"widget_banner_image-small\":{\"old_1244\":\"{\\\"path\\\":\\\"assets\\/thumbs\\/images\\/banner\\/cover_375_340_banner-about.jpg.webp\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"cover_375_340_banner-about.jpg.webp\\\",\\\"ext\\\":\\\"webp\\\",\\\"size\\\":30368,\\\"ctime\\\":1763475107,\\\"image-width\\\":375,\\\"image-height\\\":340}\"},\"widget_banner_subtitle_id\":{\"old_1244\":\"TENTANG KAMI\"},\"widget_banner_subtitle_en\":{\"old_1244\":\"About Us\"},\"widget_banner_title_id\":{\"old_1244\":\"Landasan Hukum\"},\"widget_banner_title_en\":{\"old_1244\":\"Legal Foundation\"},\"widget_content\":{\"old_1245\":\"11\"},\"widget_content_subtitle_id\":{\"old_1245\":\"Landasan Hukum Kementerian Koordinator Bidang Pangan\"},\"widget_content_subtitle_en\":{\"old_1245\":\"Legal Basis of the Coordinating Ministry for Food\"},\"widget_content_title_id\":{\"old_1245\":\"Jaringan Dokumentasi dan Informasi Hukum (JDIH) Kementerian Koordinator Bidang Pangan adalah anggota JDIH Nasional yang memegang peran strategis sebagai perwujudan amanat Undang-Undang Nomor 14 Tahun 2008 tentang Keterbukaan Informasi Publik.\"},\"widget_content_title_en\":{\"old_1245\":\"The Legal Documentation and Information Network (JDIH) of the Coordinating Ministry for Food is a member of the National JDIH which plays a strategic role as the embodiment of the mandate of Law Number 14 of 2008 concerning Public Information Disclosure.\"},\"widget_content_description_id\":{\"old_1245\":\"JDIH Kemenko Pangan bertugas menyediakan setiap informasi hukum di bidang pangan secara tertib, terpadu, dan berkesinambungan, yang merupakan kategori Informasi Publik wajib.  Sebagai pilar pembangunan hukum dan sarana rujukan pengambilan kebijakan, JDIH ini menjamin ketersediaan dokumentasi hukum yang lengkap, akurat, serta dapat diakses secara cepat dan mudah oleh publik. Secara khusus, JDIH Kemenko Pangan berkomitmen mengintegrasikan pengelolaan informasi hukum secara terpadu dengan JDIHN, demi mendukung tata pemerintahan yang baik, transparan, dan bertanggung jawab, sekaligus mempercepat pelayanan informasi hukum sesuai Undang-Undang Nomor 25 Tahun 2009 tentang Pelayanan Publik.\"},\"widget_content_description_en\":{\"old_1245\":\"The Coordinating Ministry for Food and Agriculture\'s (Kemenko Pangan) JDIH is tasked with providing all legal information in the food sector in an orderly, integrated, and sustainable manner, which is categorized as mandatory Public Information. As a pillar of legal development and a reference tool for policy-making, the JDIH ensures the availability of complete, accurate legal documentation that can be accessed quickly and easily by the public. Specifically, the Coordinating Ministry for Food and Agriculture\'s JDIH is committed to integrating legal information management in an integrated manner with the JDIHN, in order to support good, transparent, and accountable governance, while accelerating legal information services in accordance with Law Number 25 of 2009 concerning Public Services.\"},\"widget_file\":{\"old_1246\":\"12\",\"old_1247\":\"13\",\"15\":\"14\"},\"widget_file_title_id\":{\"old_1246\":\"Undang-Undang Nomor 14 Tahun 2008 tentang Keterbukaan Informasi Publik\",\"old_1247\":\"Peraturan Presiden Nomor 33 Tahun 2012 tentang Jaringan Dokumentasi dan Informasi Hukum Nasional\",\"15\":\"Keputusan Menteri Koordinator Bidang Pangan Nomor 86 Tahun 2025 Tentang Organisasi Jaringan Dokumentasi dan Informasi Hukum di Lingkungan Kementerian Koordinator Bidang Pangan\"},\"widget_file_title_en\":{\"old_1246\":\"Law Number 14 of 2008 concerning Public Information Disclosure\",\"old_1247\":\"Presidential Regulation Number 33 of 2012 concerning the National Legal Documentation and Information Network\",\"15\":\"Keputusan Menteri Koordinator Bidang Pangan Tentang Organisasi Jaringan Dokumentasi dan Informasi Hukum di Lingkungan Kementerian Koordinator Bidang Pangan\"},\"widget_file_file_id\":{\"old_1246\":\"{\\\"path\\\":\\\"files\\/landasan-hukum\\/uu-nomor-14-tahun-2008.pdf\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"uu-nomor-14-tahun-2008.pdf\\\",\\\"ext\\\":\\\"pdf\\\",\\\"size\\\":183905,\\\"ctime\\\":1764735676,\\\"image-width\\\":0,\\\"image-height\\\":0}\",\"old_1247\":\"{\\\"path\\\":\\\"files\\/landasan-hukum\\/peraturan-presiden-no-33-tahun-2012.pdf\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"peraturan-presiden-no-33-tahun-2012.pdf\\\",\\\"ext\\\":\\\"pdf\\\",\\\"size\\\":74142,\\\"ctime\\\":1764735676,\\\"image-width\\\":0,\\\"image-height\\\":0}\",\"15\":\"{\\\"path\\\":\\\"files\\/landasan-hukum\\/salinan-kepmenko-nomor-86-tahun-2025-tentang-jdih.pdf\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"salinan-kepmenko-nomor-86-tahun-2025-tentang-jdih.pdf\\\",\\\"ext\\\":\\\"pdf\\\",\\\"size\\\":325630,\\\"ctime\\\":1765942253,\\\"image-width\\\":0,\\\"image-height\\\":0}\"},\"widget_file_file_en\":{\"old_1246\":\"{\\\"path\\\":\\\"files\\/landasan-hukum\\/uu-nomor-14-tahun-2008.pdf\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"uu-nomor-14-tahun-2008.pdf\\\",\\\"ext\\\":