yang berkaitan dengan bidang hukum, antara lain:,SOP JDIH merupakan sebuah panduan yang bertujuan untuk memastikan pekerjaan dan kegiatan pengelolaan layanan JDIH berjalan dengan lancar.,https://jdih.kemenkopangan.go.id/assets/source/assets/thumbs/images/menu/cover_926_619_sop-gabung-new.png.webp ,Standar Operasional Prosedur (SOP) Pengelolaan Dokumen dan Informasi Hukum',1,'2025-12-03 04:38:30','2025-12-03 04:38:30'),(682,'menu','4','en','about-sop','About SOP',NULL,'About SOP,https://jdih.kemenkopangan.go.id/assets/source/images/banner/banner-about.jpg ,3,about-sop,About SOP,https://jdih.kemenkopangan.go.id/assets/source/assets/thumbs/images/banner/cover_1440_400_banner-about.jpg.webp ,https://jdih.kemenkopangan.go.id/assets/source/assets/thumbs/images/banner/cover_1024_480_banner-about.jpg.webp ,https://jdih.kemenkopangan.go.id/assets/source/assets/thumbs/images/banner/cover_375_340_banner-about.jpg.webp ,ABOUT US,Standard Operating Procedure (SOP),SOPs in the legal sector aim to realize good governance and ensure the smooth and transparent completion of various types of internal and external service activities within the Coordinating Ministry for Food and Agriculture.\r\n\r\nThe following is a list of SOPs related to the legal sector, including:,The JDIH SOP is a guide that aims to ensure that JDIH service management work and activities run smoothly.,https://jdih.kemenkopangan.go.id/assets/source/assets/thumbs/images/menu/cover_926_619_sop-gabung-new.png.webp ,Standard Operating Procedure (SOP) for Legal Document and Information Management',1,'2025-12-03 04:38:30','2025-12-03 04:38:30'),(693,'menu','19','id','statistik-produk-hukum','Statistik Produk Hukum',NULL,'Statistik Produk Hukum,https://jdih.kemenkopangan.go.id/assets/source/images/banner/banner-about.jpg ,3,about-statistik,Statistik Produk Hukum,https://jdih.kemenkopangan.go.id/assets/source/assets/thumbs/images/banner/cover_1440_400_banner-about.jpg.webp ,https://jdih.kemenkopangan.go.id/assets/source/assets/thumbs/images/banner/cover_1024_480_banner-about.jpg.webp ,https://jdih.kemenkopangan.go.id/assets/source/assets/thumbs/images/banner/cover_375_340_banner-about.jpg.webp ,TENTANG KAMI,Statistik Produk Hukum,Berikut ini disajikan data mengenai jumlah peraturan perundang-undangan yang telah diterbitkan pada tingkat pusat. Informasi ini mencakup keseluruhan regulasi yang berlaku secara nasional, yang terdiri dari berbagai jenis peraturan mulai dari Undang-Undang, Peraturan Pemerintah, Peraturan Presiden, hingga peraturan-peraturan lain yang menjadi bagian dari sistem hukum di Indonesia,Statistik Produk Hukum Berdasarkan Status',1,'2025-12-03 07:27:23','2025-12-03 07:27:23'),(694,'menu','19','en','legal-product-statistics','Legal Product Statistics',NULL,'Legal Product Statistics,https://jdih.kemenkopangan.go.id/assets/source/images/banner/banner-about.jpg ,3,about-statistik,Legal Product Statistics,https://jdih.kemenkopangan.go.id/assets/source/assets/thumbs/images/banner/cover_1440_400_banner-about.jpg.webp ,https://jdih.kemenkopangan.go.id/assets/source/assets/thumbs/images/banner/cover_1024_480_banner-about.jpg.webp ,https://jdih.kemenkopangan.go.id/assets/source/assets/thumbs/images/banner/cover_375_340_banner-about.jpg.webp ,ABOUT US,Legal Product Statistics,The following presents data on the number of laws and regulations issued at the central level. This information covers all applicable national regulations, comprising various types of regulations, including laws, government regulations, presidential regulations, and other regulations that form part of the Indonesian legal system.,Legal Product Statistics by Status',1,'2025-12-03 07:27:23','2025-12-03 07:27:23'),(697,'menu','22','id','faq','FAQ',NULL,'FAQ,https://jdih.kemenkopangan.go.id/assets/source/images/banner/banner-about.jpg ,faq,FAQ,https://jdih.kemenkopangan.go.id/assets/source/assets/thumbs/images/banner/cover_1440_400_banner-about.jpg.webp ,https://jdih.kemenkopangan.go.id/assets/source/assets/thumbs/images/banner/cover_1024_480_banner-about.jpg.webp ,https://jdih.kemenkopangan.go.id/assets/source/assets/thumbs/images/banner/cover_375_340_banner-about.jpg.webp ,Frequently Asked Questions,FAQ',0,'2025-12-04 03:36:44','2025-12-06 04:19:24'),(698,'menu','22','en','faq-en','FAQ',NULL,'FAQ,https://jdih.kemenkopangan.go.id/assets/source/images/banner/banner-about.jpg ,faq,FAQ,https://jdih.kemenkopangan.go.id/assets/source/assets/thumbs/images/banner/cover_1440_400_banner-about.jpg.webp ,https://jdih.kemenkopangan.go.id/assets/source/assets/thumbs/images/banner/cover_1024_480_banner-about.jpg.webp ,https://jdih.kemenkopangan.go.id/assets/source/assets/thumbs/images/banner/cover_375_340_banner-about.jpg.webp ,Frequently Asked Questions,FAQ',0,'2025-12-04 03:36:44','2025-12-06 04:19:24'),(703,'menu','5','id','visi-misi','Visi Misi',NULL,'Visi Misi,https://jdih.kemenkopangan.go.id/assets/source/images/banner/banner-about.jpg ,3,about-visimisi,Visi Misi,https://jdih.kemenkopangan.go.id/assets/source/assets/thumbs/images/banner/cover_1440_400_banner-about.jpg.webp ,https://jdih.kemenkopangan.go.id/assets/source/assets/thumbs/images/banner/cover_1024_480_banner-about.jpg.webp ,https://jdih.kemenkopangan.go.id/assets/source/assets/thumbs/images/banner/cover_375_340_banner-about.jpg.webp ,TENTANG KAMI,Visi Misi,https://jdih.kemenkopangan.go.id/assets/source/assets/thumbs/images/cover_1070_240_bg-visi.png.webp visi,https://jdih.kemenkopangan.go.id/assets/source/assets/thumbs/images/cover_1024_400_bg-visi.png.webp ,https://jdih.kemenkopangan.go.id/assets/source/assets/thumbs/images/cover_327_520_bg-visi-s.png.webp ,Visi Kami,Menjadi Pusat Rujukan Informasi Hukum Pangan Nasional yang terintegrasi, cerdas (smart), terpercaya, yang berlandaskan pada nilai-nilai SIAP (Sinergi, Integritas, Adaptif, dan Profesional) sebagai pilar utama dalam mewujudkan tata kelola pemerintahan,Pengelolaan Dokumen dan Informasi Hukum Berbasis Integrasi DigitalMengelola, menyediakan, dan menjamin keakuratan, kelengkapan, serta keseragaman dokumen hukum sektor pangan secara terpusat dan sistematis. Membangun platform JDIH yang terintegrasi dengan seluruh pemangku kepentingan untuk memastikan akses informasi yang cepat dan valid.Peningkatan Transparansi dan Aksesibilitas PublikMeningkatkan transparansi dan keterbukaan informasi hukum bidang pangan bagi publik, pemangku kepentingan, dan aparatur negara. Menyediakan akses mudah, akurat, dan gratis terhadap dokumen hukum, dan informasi legalitas kebijakan pangan melalui platform digital yang ramah pengguna.Dukungan Strategis terhadap Formulasi dan Harmonisasi Kebijakan PanganMenyediakan dukungan analisis dan rekomendasi hukum yang berkualitas untuk meminimalisir konflik dan tumpang tindih regulasi. Memastikan bahwa setiap kebijakan pangan yang disusun konsisten, harmonis, dan selaras dengan kerangka hukum nasional dan internasional.Pengembangan Sistem JDIH Cerdas (Smart) dan Kelembagaan BerkelanjutanMengembangkan sistem JDIH berbasis teknologi informasi yang adaptif dan berkelanjutan, termasuk pemanfaatan kecerdasan buatan (AI) untuk pemetaan hukum, penandaan regulasi, dan notifikasi otomatis. Memperkuat kolaborasi dengan pusat JDIHN dan anggota JDIHN lainnya untuk sinergi dokumentasi dan informasi hukum nasional.,MISI KAMI',1,'2025-12-06 04:05:19','2025-12-06 04:05:19'),(704,'menu','5','en','vision-mission','Vision Mission',NULL,'Vision Mission,https://jdih.kemenkopangan.go.id/assets/source/images/banner/banner-about.jpg ,3,about-visimisi,Vision Mission,https://jdih.kemenkopangan.go.id/assets/source/assets/thumbs/images/banner/cover_1440_400_banner-about.jpg.webp ,https://jdih.kemenkopangan.go.id/assets/source/assets/thumbs/images/banner/cover_1024_480_banner-about.jpg.webp ,https://jdih.kemenkopangan.go.id/assets/source/assets/thumbs/images/banner/cover_375_340_banner-about.jpg.webp ,ABOUT US,Vision Mission,https://jdih.kemenkopangan.go.id/assets/source/assets/thumbs/images/cover_1070_240_bg-visi.png.webp ,https://jdih.kemenkopangan.go.id/assets/source/assets/thumbs/images/cover_1024_400_bg-visi.png.webp ,https://jdih.kemenkopangan.go.id/assets/source/assets/thumbs/images/cover_327_520_bg-visi-s.png.webp ,Our Vision,To become an integrated, smart, and trusted National Food Law Information Reference Center, as a main pillar in realizing consistent, transparent, and accountable food governance.,Digitally Integrated Legal Document and Information Management&nbsp;Manage, provide, and guarantee the accuracy, completeness, and uniformity of legal documents in the food sector in a centralized and systematic manner. Build an integrated JDIH platform with all stakeholders to ensure fast and valid access to information.&nbsp;&nbsp;Improving Public Transparency and Accessibility&nbsp;Improve transparency and openness of legal information in the food sector for the public, stakeholders, and state officials. Provide easy, accurate, and free access to legal documents and information on the legality of food policies through a user-friendly digital platform.&nbsp;&nbsp;Strategic Support for Food Policy Formulation and Harmonization&nbsp;Provide quality legal analysis and recommendations to minimize regulatory conflicts and overlaps. Ensure that every formulated food policy is consistent, harmonized, and aligned with national and international legal frameworks.&nbsp;&nbsp;Development of a Smart JDIH System and Sustainable Institutions&nbsp;Develop an adaptive and sustainable information technology-based JDIH system, including the use of artificial intelligence (AI) for legal mapping, regulatory tagging, and automatic notifications. Strengthening collaboration with JDIHN centers and other JDIHN members for synergy of national legal documentation and information.,OUR MISSION',1,'2025-12-06 04:05:19','2025-12-06 04:05:19'),(803,'document-peraturan','17','id','keputusan-menteri-koordinator-bidang-pangan-nomor-53mpangankep092025-tentang-pejabat-pengelola-informasi-dan-dokumentasi-di-lingkunga