7147,\"image-width\":375,\"image-height\":340}'),(10041,2541,'id','subtitle','TENTANG KAMI'),(10042,2541,'en','subtitle','ABOUT US'),(10043,2541,'id','title','Struktur Organisasi'),(10044,2541,'en','title','Organizational Structure'),(10045,2542,'id','title','Berikut ini adalah susunan organisasi di lingkungan Biro Hukum dan Kerja Sama Kementerian Koordinator Bidang Pangan:'),(10046,2542,'en','title','The following is the organizational structure within the Legal and Cooperation Bureau of the Coordinating Ministry for Food:'),(10047,2543,'id','subtitle','Struktur Organisasi di Lingkungan Biro Hukum dan Kerja Sama Kementerian Koordinator Bidang Pangan'),(10048,2543,'en','subtitle','Organizational Structure within the Legal and Cooperation Bureau of the Coordinating Ministry for Food'),(10049,2543,'id','title','Struktur Organisasi Biro Hukum dan Kerja Sama'),(10050,2543,'en','title','Organizational Structure of the Legal and Cooperation Bureau'),(10051,2543,'id','image','{\"path\":\"images/menu/group-482462-1.png.webp\",\"name\":\"group-482462-1.png.webp\",\"ext\":\"webp\",\"size\":155188,\"ctime\":1788925706,\"image-width\":3693,\"image-height\":1578}'),(10052,2543,'en','image','{\"path\":\"images/menu/rev-biro-hks-1.png.webp\",\"name\":\"rev-biro-hks-1.png.webp\",\"ext\":\"webp\",\"size\":129998,\"ctime\":1764745713,\"image-width\":4092,\"image-height\":992}'),(10053,2544,'id','subtitle','Struktur Organisasi JDIH Kementerian Koordinator Bidang Pangan'),(10054,2544,'en','subtitle','Organizational Structure of JDIH Coordinating Ministry for Food'),(10055,2544,'id','title','Bahwa untuk memberikan pemenuhan masyarakat atas dokumen dan informasi hukum sebagai bagian dari upaya mencerdaskan kehidupan bangsa dan menciptakan penyelenggaraan ketatapemerintahan yang baik, perlu dilakukan melalui pelayanan dari jaringan dokumentasi dan informasi hukum. Dan untuk melaksanakan ketentuan Pasal 5 ayat (1) Peraturan Presiden Nomor 33 Tahun 2012 tentang Jaringan Dokumentasi dan Informasi Hukum Nasional, perlu membentuk organisasi jaringan dokumentasi dan informasi hukum di lingkungan Kementerian Koordinator Bidang Pangan.'),(10056,2544,'en','title','That in order to provide the public with the fulfillment of legal documents and information as part of the effort to enlighten the nation\'s life and create good governance, it is necessary to do this through services from the legal documentation and information network. And to implement the provisions of Article 5 paragraph (1) of Presidential Regulation Number 33 of 2012 concerning the National Legal Documentation and Information Network, it is necessary to form a legal documentation and information network organization within the Coordinating Ministry for Food. For this reason, it is necessary to draft a Regulation of the Coordinating Minister for Food concerning the Legal Documentation and Information Network Organization within the Coordinating Ministry for Food, where the JDIH organization of the Coordinating Ministry consists of: the JDIH Center and JDIH Members. The JDIH Center of the Coordinating Ministry is implemented by the Bureau of Law and Cooperation.'),(10057,2544,'id','image','{\"path\":\"images/menu/svdh.png.webp\",\"name\":\"svdh.png.webp\",\"ext\":\"webp\",\"size\":184172,\"ctime\":1788926123,\"image-width\":3742,\"image-height\":2866}'),(10058,2544,'en','image','{\"path\":\"images/menu/rev-organisasi-jdih-1.png.webp\",\"name\":\"rev-organisasi-jdih-1.png.webp\",\"ext\":\"webp\",\"size\":133580,\"ctime\":1764745874,\"image-width\":3491,\"image-height\":1897}'),(10059,2545,'id','subtitle','Struktur Tim Teknis JDIH Kementerian Koordinator Bidang Pangan'),(10060,2545,'en','subtitle','JDIH Technical Team Structure of the Coordinating Ministry for Food'),(10061,2545,'id','title','Struktur Tim Teknis JDIH Kementerian Koordinator Bidang Pangan'),(10062,2545,'en','title','JDIH Technical Team Structure of the Coordinating Ministry for Food'),(10063,2545,'id','image','{\"path\":\"images/m